OL,3,GNEWSA'My late father inspires me to
OL,4,Ahelp hundreds of runners'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe winner of a national award
OL,7,Frecognising her work to help hundreds
OL,8,Fof people discover running and improve
OL,9,Ftheir confidence says it is all down to
OL,10,Fthe continuing inspiration of her late
OL,11,Ffather.
OL,13,FSonia Tudor was named England
OL,14,FAthletics' National Unsung Hero of the
OL,15,FYear, at an award ceremony on Sunday,
OL,16,Fattended by the likes of world champion
OL,17,Fheptathlete Katarina Johnson-Thompson.
