OL,3,GNEWSA'My late father inspires me to
OL,4,Ahelp hundreds of runners'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I used to run with my daddy and
OL,7,Fsuddenly he passed away," said the
OL,8,Fvolunteer with Redditch Community
OL,9,FRunners (RCR), a group she set up with
OL,10,Ffriends that has now been recognised
OL,11,Ffor its inclusivity.
OL,13,F"Before... we had a little
OL,14,Fheart-to-heart. He told me, 'Never stop
OL,15,Fbeing you, bear,' that's what he used
OL,16,Fto call me. He said, 'Whatever you do,
OL,17,Ftry and make a difference'."
